TI  - Shedding Light on the Etiology of Sports Injuries: A Look Behind the Scenes of Time-to-Event Analyses
T2  - JOURNAL OF ORTHOPAEDIC & SPORTS PHYSICAL THERAPY
LA  - English
KW  - injury prevention
KW  - methodology
KW  - statistics
KW  - time-varying variables
