TI  - CHANGES IN HEART RATE VARIABILITY IN RESPONSE TO MUSCULAR LOAD AND THEIR CORRELATION WITH THE CONCENTRATION OF STEROID HORMONES IN YOUNG MALES WITH DIFFERENT TRAINING SPECIFICS
T2  - HUMAN SPORT MEDICINE
