TI  - What Differentiates Elite, Sub-Elite, and Amateur Young Soccer Players? A Comparative Analysis of Match-Play Locomotor Demands
T2  - APPLIED SCIENCES-BASEL
LA  - English
KW  - external load
KW  - locomotor demands
KW  - GPS devices
