TI  - Assessing physical fitness adaptations in collegiate male soccer players through training load parameters: a two-arm randomized study on combined small-sided games and running-based high-intensity interval training
T2  - FRONTIERS IN PHYSIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - football
