TI  - A Lightweight, Simple-Structure, Low-Cost and Compliant Twisted String Actuator Featuring Continuously Variable Transmission
T2  - ACTUATORS
LA  - English
KW  - twisted string actuator
KW  - continuously variable transmission
KW  - anthropomorphic robot finger
KW  - DYNAMICS
