TI  - Does cumulating endurance training at the weekends impair training effectiveness?
T2  - EUROPEAN JOURNAL OF CARDIOVASCULAR PREVENTION & REHABILITATION
LA  - English
CP  - German Congress of Sports Medicine
KW  - ergometry
KW  - exercise
