TI  - Dependence of heart rate variability on heart period in disease and aging
T2  - PHYSIOLOGICAL MEASUREMENT
LA  - English
KW  - heart rate variability
KW  - heart period
KW  - nonlinear dynamics
KW  - aging
KW  - congestive heart failure
