TI  - Normalizing Acceleration and Power in Elite Soccer With Acceleration-Speed Profiles: A Case Study of Game Segment, Position, and Goal Differential
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF SPORTS PHYSIOLOGY AND PERFORMANCE
LA  - English
