TI  - Changes Related to Fatigue in Cardiorespiratory Response Sensitivity to Hypoxic and Hypercapnic Stimulation during Strenuous Physical Load
T2  - BALTIC JOURNAL OF HEALTH AND PHYSICAL ACTIVITY
LA  - English
KW  - fatigue
