TI  - Physiological Responses and Swimming-Performance Changes Induced by Altering the Sequence of Training Sets
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF SPORTS PHYSIOLOGY AND PERFORMANCE
LA  - English
KW  - interval training
KW  - heart-rate variability
