TI  - How far from the gold standard? Comparing the accuracy of a Local Position Measurement (LPM) system and a 15 Hz GPS to a laser for measuring acceleration and running speed during team sports
T2  - PLOS ONE
LA  - English
KW  - ELITE SOCCER PLAYERS
KW  - CONCURRENT VALIDITY
