TI  - Acute and persistent effects of a 46-kilometre wilderness trail run at altitude: Cardiovascular autonomic modulation and baroreflexes
T2  - CARDIOVASCULAR RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - exercise
KW  - autonomic nervous system
