TI  - Assessing Dynamic Atrioventricular Conduction Time to RR-interval Coupling in Athletes and Sedentary Subjects
T2  - ARQUIVOS BRASILEIROS DE CARDIOLOGIA
LA  - English
KW  - Athletes
KW  - Adults
