TI  - Intensity and Load Characteristics of Professional Road Cycling: Differences Between Men's and Women's Races
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF SPORTS PHYSIOLOGY AND PERFORMANCE
LA  - English
KW  - training impulse
KW  - training load
KW  - performance
KW  - heart rate
