TI  - Heart Rate Monitor Instead of Ablation? Atrioventricular Nodal Re-Entrant Tachycardia in a Leisure-Time Triathlete: 6-Year Follow-Up
T2  - DIAGNOSTICS
LA  - English
KW  - AVNRT
KW  - endurance training
