TI  - Evolution of physiological and haematological parameters with training load in elite male road cyclists:: a longitudinal study
T2  - JOURNAL OF SPORTS MEDICINE AND PHYSICAL FITNESS
LA  - English
KW  - training
KW  - cycling
KW  - hematological tests
