TI  - Cognitive functioning enhancement in older adults: is there an advantage of multicomponent training over Nordic walking?
T2  - CLINICAL INTERVENTIONS IN AGING
LA  - English
KW  - aerobic training
KW  - cognition
KW  - motor fitness
